<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BATECOR SETS TERMS OF RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>BATECOR SETS TERMS OF RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Batecor Industrial Corp Ltd announced on Monday it would issue some 16.5 million shares at 190 cents each in its 31.3 million rand rights issue.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that shareholders registered in the company's books on October 25 would be offered 17 shares for every 100 held.</p>
<p>The company announced in September that it planned to hold a rights issue in order to reduce &quot;unacceptably high gearing&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
